WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.440
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Spanish science-fiction thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:15.920
called “The Last Days.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.040
The premise of the movie is set&nbsp;
in a post-apocalyptic society.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:26.640
After a mysterious disease spreads all across&nbsp;
the world, people become extremely agoraphobic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:32.160
meaning that they develop a fear of the outdoors.&nbsp;
The disease takes over so quickly that the people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.760
who are outside when it happens, die instantly.&nbsp;
While the survivors stay wherever they are.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.160
It is currently three months after the&nbsp;
disease took over and a cure has still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:46.800
not been found. The world has collapsed as&nbsp;
people stopped coming out of their houses.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.480
An office worker named Marc was at work when&nbsp;
the pandemic took over. Ever since then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:57.040
he has not been able to return home to his&nbsp;
wife Julia. At the beginning of the movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.840
Marc scavenges through his office building&nbsp;
for food. Alongside him, his coworkers are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.960
busy going about their day as they have for&nbsp;
several months now. He tries to use the phone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.800
but as expected, it doesn’t work. A view of the&nbsp;
city through the window shows us the destruction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.760
caused by the pandemic. Marc looks at the&nbsp;
empty streets while eating a piece of bread.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:23.440
His colleague asks him to come downstairs because&nbsp;
it is his turn to work. For the past month,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:28.560
they have been making a tunnel that they can use&nbsp;
to go places since they cannot walk outside.
&nbsp;

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:33.440
As Marc hits the wall, he creates a hole in&nbsp;
it and finds out that the other end meets a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:39.120
subway tunnel. Later, everyone is being given&nbsp;
rationed food supplies. While waiting in line,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:45.840
Marc sees his former boss Enrique hiding a GPS in&nbsp;
his pocket. When he asks him what the GPS is for,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:51.600
Enrique dismisses the matter. A flashback reveals&nbsp;
that before the pandemic, Marc was working as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:57.680
computer engineer. One day, Enrique calls him into&nbsp;
the office and asks him about a deadline that Marc&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:03.520
had missed earlier. He threatens Marc for possible&nbsp;
termination from the job if he isn’t efficient&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:09.520
enough the next time. Marc works overtime that&nbsp;
night and ignores the calls from his wife Julia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.960
He returns home late to see Julia has already&nbsp;
had dinner. The couple talks about their plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:20.320
to have a baby soon. Marc doesn’t want to rush&nbsp;
the subject when he is having trouble at work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.200
but Julia is impatient. They have had several&nbsp;
arguments about the matter in the past.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:31.920
At night, Marc cannot fall asleep so he&nbsp;
watches the news about a sixteen years&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:38.320
old teen who commits suicide after staying inside&nbsp;
his house for more than six months. He had severe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:44.240
agoraphobia but his father didn’t understand or&nbsp;
believe him, leading him to commit suicide. 
&nbsp;

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:49.920
The following day in office, everyone discusses&nbsp;
the teen’s tragic death. Marc notices that one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:54.720
his colleagues, Rovira, is wearing the same&nbsp;
clothes that he did for the last few days.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:00.720
It is almost as if he hasn’t returned home. At the&nbsp;
time, Marc didn’t understand what Rovira’s problem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:06.320
was but looking back at it now, he was one of&nbsp;
the first people to get infected by the disease.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:12.480
In the present, Marc and Enrique are in Enrique’s&nbsp;
office secretly discussing the GPS. Since the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:17.600
phone’s GPS has stopped working, Marc needs&nbsp;
the device to reach his apartment. Enrique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:22.080
requests Marc not to tell the others about&nbsp;
the device or else they will probably steal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:27.760
it in the time of crisis. Marc reveals that he&nbsp;
has stolen supplies formerly owned by Rovira.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:32.720
Using both of their tools, they can partner up&nbsp;
and help each other reach their destinations.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:38.560
Enrique also needs help in going to Vila Olímpia,&nbsp;
but he doesn’t specify his reasons. Enrique is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:44.400
initially dismissive of Marc's idea and declines&nbsp;
to partner with him, but Marc blackmails him into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:50.160
helping him search for Julia. The two set out into&nbsp;
the subway system, and start their journey. Some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:55.440
hours later, they reach the subway station which&nbsp;
has now become home to hundreds of people. 
&nbsp;

00:03:55.440 --> 00:04:01.840
All of a sudden, a pickpocket snatches Enrique’s&nbsp;
bag with supplies and runs away. They chase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:06.800
after him and reach a secluded area with the&nbsp;
pickpocket’s gang members. The thugs make the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:12.400
two kneel down, wanting to steal all their&nbsp;
supplies. Fortunately for Enrique and Marc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:16.480
the power goes out right on time,&nbsp;
and they attack the group of thugs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:21.840
In the fight, Enrique kills the leader. Although&nbsp;
worried that Enrique will continue without him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:27.360
Marc is relieved to find that he is willing to&nbsp;
continue their partnership. Another flashback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:32.800
shows us, Marc, getting ready to go to the&nbsp;
office unknown of what is coming. On his way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:37.760
he enters his neighbor’s home which is filled&nbsp;
with trash that seems to have accumulated over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:43.360
the course of months. It is clear that he has also&nbsp;
been infected but has no clue what is going on.
&nbsp;

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:49.440
At work, the officials find out that Rovira has&nbsp;
been living in his office for several weeks. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:54.320
kick him out of the building as he begs for his&nbsp;
life. People think he is being too dramatic but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.320 --> 00:05:00.080
as soon as he is taken outdoors, he gets a&nbsp;
seizure and dies. Following that, Marc goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:05.840
through his belongings and sees that Rovira has&nbsp;
accumulated food and other supplies. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.560
Marc tells Julia that something is happening&nbsp;
around them that they are not aware of yet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:15.920
The incidents bother Marc but he doesn’t know what&nbsp;
he can do about them. Julia hugs him but believes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:22.160
that he is worrying for no reason. They make love&nbsp;
before going to sleep. Back in the present, Marc&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:27.680
wakes up dreaming of her. He gets worried when he&nbsp;
sees no one around but is relieved when Enrique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:32.400
approaches him moments later. The two continue&nbsp;
their journey through the subway tunnel. Marc&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:38.080
inquires why Enrique wants to go to Vila Olimpia&nbsp;
but he dismisses the conversation. He also has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:43.280
been collecting seeds of several fruits throughout&nbsp;
the journey which Marc thinks is weird. 
&nbsp;

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:48.080
After walking for some miles, they find the&nbsp;
opening to the sewer system. They jump into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:53.120
the sewer and use the GPS to get to the building&nbsp;
that Marc lived in. To get out of the sewer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:58.240
they will have to blow up a gas cylinder and make&nbsp;
a hole through the ground. They miss the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:04.320
two tries but are eventually able to create the&nbsp;
explosion. Marc finally gets to his room but sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:10.400
that it is occupied by a strange man. At first, he&nbsp;
thinks that the man has abducted his wife but it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:15.200
turns out that he and his family were working in&nbsp;
the building. When they got infected they couldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:20.880
return home so they took shelter in his apartment.&nbsp;
On being asked about Julia, they claim that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:26.240
the apartment was empty when they came in. Enrique&nbsp;
looks around the kitchen and finds that the family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:31.920
has caught birds for food. He also collects corn&nbsp;
kernels and puts them inside the bag with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:37.680
other seeds. Meanwhile, Marc finds a hospital&nbsp;
paper with Julia’s ultrasound report in it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:43.120
It is then revealed that she was pregnant when&nbsp;
they last met. We are shown yet another flashback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:48.560
where Marc and Julia are watching the news about&nbsp;
the disease spreading at an exponential rate. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:54.240
condition is now known as “the panic” and several&nbsp;
people have already died because of it. 
&nbsp;

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:59.360
Julia brings up the topic of having children&nbsp;
and they, yet again, get into an argument.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:05.360
While walking to work, Marc notices the streets&nbsp;
and the train are emptier than usual. People at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:10.560
work are also listening to the news where the&nbsp;
“experts” claim the cause of “the panic” is just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:16.640
mass hysteria. Marc feels guilty for arguing with&nbsp;
Julia but when he calls, her friend Andrea picks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:23.360
up the phone. Wanting to talk to Julia, he leaves&nbsp;
to go home. However, as soon as he steps outside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:31.040
he falls to the ground, panicking. Marc has also&nbsp;
been infected by the disease. He somehow drags&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:37.520
himself inside the building. In the present, it&nbsp;
suddenly starts to rain. Enrique and Marc collect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:42.800
water with the help of a curtain and a bucket.&nbsp;
Everyone in the apartments does the same as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:48.080
At night, the two collect as many supplies as&nbsp;
they can and leave for their next destination.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:52.640
Marc wants to go to the mall that Julia used&nbsp;
to work in but Enrique says that they are going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:57.520
to Vila Olimpia next. Since they have reached&nbsp;
his apartment building, he no longer wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.520 --> 00:08:02.960
accompany Marc. They get into a fistfight which&nbsp;
ends almost immediately after they accidentally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:08.240
break the flashlight. Enrique then reveals that&nbsp;
he wants to go to the hospital that his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:14.640
is in. After finding him, he promises to give&nbsp;
the GPS to Marc, so he accepts the deal.
&nbsp;

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.680
The two continue the journey and end up in&nbsp;
an abandoned church at the end of the night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:25.280
They find a lighter and use it to light a fire,&nbsp;
hoping to have a cozy night. However, their plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:31.360
is ruined when they are attacked by a wild bear.&nbsp;
It attacks Enrique and is almost about to maul him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:37.440
to death but Marc manages to kill it at the right&nbsp;
time. Following that, they cook the bear’s flesh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:42.560
and devour it. As they eat, they talk about&nbsp;
their lives before the pandemic. It turns out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:52.320
Enrique’s only family is his father who he loves&nbsp;
dearly. As they get to know more about each other,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:57.440
they start to bond. The next day, they continue&nbsp;
the journey through the sewers to the hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:02.480
On their way, they meet another group of survivors&nbsp;
who claim that they have heard the rumors about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:08.480
the hospital being burned to the ground. Enrique&nbsp;
freaks out and runs to a building’s top. There,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:14.960
through a glass window, he sees that the hospital&nbsp;
has in fact burned. Since his father was paralyzed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:21.600
and was on the fifth floor, he loses all hopes of&nbsp;
his survival. With no one to love or look after,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:27.840
Enrique loses the will to live and tries to&nbsp;
jump off the window but Marc saves him.
&nbsp;

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:32.720
Enrique now wants Marc to continue looking&nbsp;
for Julia on his own. He even hands the man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:38.880
his bag of seeds, saying that his child will need&nbsp;
them in the future. After an emotional goodbye,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:43.040
they part ways and Marc makes his&nbsp;
way to the mall that Julia worked in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:48.000
He reaches the mall without much problem and&nbsp;
finds several dead bodies lying on the ground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:53.040
People there seem to have fought their lives off.&nbsp;
He enters the shop that Julia worked in, only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:59.360
to find its owner dead on the floor. Fortunately&nbsp;
for him, Julia’s friend Andrea has written a note&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:04.720
saying that they are at the supermarket. On&nbsp;
his way there, he meets a group of survivors.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:10.560
They are reluctant to let him in but they agree&nbsp;
to see if someone named Julia is in their group.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:16.480
Before they can get back to him a rival group&nbsp;
attacks them. The ensuing fight causes most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:22.400
of the people from both groups to die. Amidst the&nbsp;
chaos, Marc meets Andrea who tells him that Julia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:28.640
has gone to the gynecologist after Marc ended the&nbsp;
call that day. They try to run away but Andrea is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:35.040
killed by falling debris. Following that, a man&nbsp;
attacks Marc and is about to kill him but Enrique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:40.960
arrives at the right moment and saves him. 
But just after, Enrique is stabbed in the chest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:45.920
He hides his injury from Marc and offers to join&nbsp;
him to search for Julia. They walk through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:50.800
tunnel and end up in an auditorium. Marc runs&nbsp;
to one of the upper floors of the building and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:57.040
sees Julia in the opposite building through the&nbsp;
window. Julia also notices him and is overjoyed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:03.040
Marc quickly runs back to tell Enrique about her&nbsp;
but finds him bleeding to death. Enrique urges him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:10.000
to go find Julia and live his life happily before&nbsp;
passing away. Now, Julia and Marc are at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:16.400
entrance of two opposite buildings. Marc takes the&nbsp;
chance and runs across the street to meet her. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:24.000
head gets lighter and his ears start to bleed but&nbsp;
he somehow manages to get to his wife in the end.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:29.200
The two finally reunite and look at each&nbsp;
other with tears of joy. Some months later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:33.760
Julia gives birth to a healthy boy. They&nbsp;
use the seeds that Enrique had given Marc&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:39.520
to create a greenhouse. As their kid grows up,&nbsp;
he takes his first step into the outside world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:45.360
proving that he is immune to agoraphobia. When&nbsp;
he is a teenager, several other kids his age&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:51.680
come to take him to rebuild civilization. The&nbsp;
movie ends as Marc and Julia watch their son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:56.640
walk away with his group of friends. 
